WEBVTT

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.150
Just a bit more and this
elementary school will be completed.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.660
All right.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.910
This village is well
on its way to recovery.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:22.910
I'm so glad.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.750
Sis Perrine!

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.550
What's the matter?

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.970
My friend... can't come to school.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
Oh dear. Why is that?

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
Come with me.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:38.760
Huh?

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:45.810
There.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.650
The bridge...

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.950
See, that's why my friend can't come to school.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:45.600
Neuroi spotted!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.850
Everyone to battle positions!

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:48.770
Roger!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.730
She moved up so quickly!

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.040
You went too far ahead!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.920
Got it!

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:25.970
The bridge!

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.270
The damage is minor.
Do not break formation!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.600
The next attack is incoming!

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.690
Perrine!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:35.230
How dare you strike the bridge!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.780
Perrine-san's amazing...

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.570
Now's our chance! Everyone, attack!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:43.160
Roger!

00:03:58.710 --> 00:03:59.800
I can see the core!

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:03.380
How dare you blast the bridge!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.390
Perrine-san!

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.810
You did it.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:25.360
Excellent work, everyone.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.780
You all fought well.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.200
And you've gotten quite used to
the Magnificent Lightning, Miyafuji.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.200
Oh, yes.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.460
I want to keep practicing
until I can use it flawlessly.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.170
All right. That's the spirit.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.540
Perrine!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.500
Perrine?

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:42.550
Y-Y-Yes?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:45.130
You were our MVP today.

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.720
Oh... Thank you.

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:51.100
She seems a bit off.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:51.720
Right?

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:53.680
What's the matter?

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.060
'Cause normally being praised by the Major would make her go...

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:02.360
"Oh, Major! That's just
how I am sometimes!"

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.400
"Please give me more of your praise."

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:06.780
Et cetera.

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:08.410
R-Really?

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:20.590
Of all the Clostermann family heirlooms passed down through the years,

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.590
this rapier is all that remains.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.680
But if I sell it...

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:31.430
Will it net enough money to fix that bridge?

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:42.360
<i>Father, Mother, what should I do?</i>

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.610
Perrine-san!

00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.410
Perrine-san?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.450
Are you okay?

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:56.620
What's the matter with you?!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.000
Shouting and barging
into my room like that!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.790
Uh, the beach.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.710
Everyone's going to
the beach tomorrow.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.010
Th-The beach?

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.720
Yahoo!

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.140
Hurry!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.930
We're going, too.

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.810
W-W-Wait!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.770
At least stretch first!

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:24.900
Don't splash me!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:27.820
Listen up!

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.740
Don't slack off because this is just a drill!

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.160
Be careful. We haven't done it in a while.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.830
So we're here to do <i>that</i> drill...

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:38.660
We're doing it again?

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.420
Why am I forced to join?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.500
Get your butts in the water!

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.220
The weather sure is nice.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.760
It really is.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.850
First one back as usual, Perrine.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.520
Y-Yes. It's because
of all the daily practice.

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:05.360
I'm prepared for anythi-

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.690
St-Stop! I'm sinking!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.540
Drill over!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.960
I'm so hungry.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.090
I'm sleepy.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.300
That was a real workout.

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.550
Yeah, because we haven't done it in quite some time.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.220
Perrine-san really saved us there.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.390
And thanks to you guys, I nearly drowned.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:40.930
Sheesh.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.440
What a lovely bridge.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.690
Perrine-san?

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.990
Lucchini-chan!

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:56.410
What're you doing?

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.040
Guys, guys! There's
a chest on the sea floor!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.200
Huh? A chest?

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:06.630
Yeah, it's big and has a lock on it. There might be treasure inside!

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:07.460
Huh?

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.420
A treasure chest?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.550
A treasure chest?!

00:08:11.210 --> 00:08:16.090
Th-The Adriatic sea was
a popular trade route in the past.

00:08:16.090 --> 00:08:20.720
It's not surprising to find
a treasure chest or two down there.

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:22.140
Wow!

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.940
This sounds fun, Lynne-chan.
Let's go check it out.

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:25.560
Okay!

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.310
Now, wait just a minute.

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:31.110
Do you really believe a ridiculous story like there being a treasure chest down there?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.150
But you said it was there yourself.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.650
I did no such thing!

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:37.280
I was just saying it's possible.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.180
<i>I can't hold my breath any longer.</i>

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:02.270
<i>Lynne-chan! Lucchini-chan!</i>

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.850
<i>I can't hold mine either.</i>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.890
<i>Hey, you guys!</i>

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.020
<i>I'm at my limit. But...</i>

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.530
<i>If this really has treasure in it...</i>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.620
<i>The bridge!</i>

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.990
<i>Tonnerre!</i>

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:36.680
Perrine-san is taking a long time.

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:38.090
I wonder if she's okay.

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.970
I just hope she wasn't eaten.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:40.760
What?!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:45.230
I mean, the bottom of the
sea is full of scary creatures.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.520
What?!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:47.940
There are giant squids...

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.690
And giant sea cucumbers...

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:52.150
And giant starfish!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.980
We have to go look for her!

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:55.570
You're right!

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:02.330
A Neuroi-

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:06.160
Who are you... calling... a Neuroi?

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.870
Oh, it's Perrine-san.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:13.380
You really wanted
the treasure badly, huh?

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.920
I-I... got... the treasure...

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:18.590
Perrine-san!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.090
Perrine-san! Perrine-san!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:25.390
Did you hear something?

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.680
Nope.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.030
Thanks for being so patient, everyone.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.580
Look! The bridge is complete!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.540
Thank you, sis Perrine!

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.080
Thanks!

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.050
Perrine-san!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:57.300
Perrine-san!

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.170
Thank heavens...

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.380
Perrine-san?

00:11:01.380 --> 00:11:02.470
Thank God she's all right.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:04.970
I wonder what's inside!

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.640
Yer all mine now, la-la-la...

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:14.230
Just what do you think you're doing, Ensign Francesca Lucchini?

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:17.690
It's already been decided what we will use the treasure for.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.030
It's open!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:25.620
Huh?!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.330
Another chest.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.670
Yeah.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:36.170
That's just proof of how
valuable the treasure is.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.130
I bet it's filled with gold and silver.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.220
Just how many are there?

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.430
It's just chest after chest.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.020
When do we get to the treasure?

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:51.060
Can you please be quiet?

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.650
This is undoubtedly the final one.

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.560
I'm opening it.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.020
Okay.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.110
It's empty.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.030
We've been fooled!

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:03.490
This can't be...

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:10.120
How can there be no treasure? Now the kids won't get their...

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.040
P-Perrine-san?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.250
Wh-What's wrong?

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.090
All right! All done!

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:23.340
I see. So you were focused on repairing the bridge all along.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:27.930
So that's why you've been acting
strange since you got back from Gallia.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:32.100
I guess you can't get
money so easily after all.

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:35.850
Now even if I sold my family's rapier...

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:36.940
Perrine-san?

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.820
Huh? Something's making a strange noise.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.110
Noise?

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:43.740
Yeah. Even though there's nothing
inside, it's making a strange sound.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:44.650
See?

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.910
Maybe it's...

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:48.780
Let me see it.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.030
Huh?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:55.290
There's a place that makes these in my neighborhood.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:56.880
Got it!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.790
That's...

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.800
It looks like a map.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.670
Could it be...

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.300
It's a treasure map.

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:07.390
Here!

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.800
Yes, it's just where the map said it'd be.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.970
Wow, so you can read it, Perrine-san.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.680
It's written in Latin, right?

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:18.610
Any girl from a proper
household can read Latin.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.150
Wow...

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:23.150
I'm so glad you're back to your old self, Perrine-san.

00:13:23.150 --> 00:13:25.360
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.030
Come on. I'm going in.

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:28.950
Me too!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:33.290
Let's go, Lynne-chan.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:33.830
Okay.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.850
It's so beautiful!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.140
Wow! It's like a starlit sky!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:59.270
Light from the entrance to the
cave is reflecting off the water.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.060
It's incredible.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:08.360
Ah, the path continues over there.

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.490
Which way do we go?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:16.040
Both of them look like they lead in deeper.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.080
This way.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.500
Seriously?

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:21.040
If you don't want to be left behind, you'll hush up and follow me.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.090
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.960
Lucchini-san's missing?

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:29.510
Yeah. She said something about going fishing
and left for the rocky area, but hasn't returned.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:30.760
Come to think of it,

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.220
Miyafuji and the others supposedly went there after the drill.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.270
Let's go and investigate.

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.560
It's so beautiful.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.440
The moss on the walls is glowing...

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.980
Are you okay? Can you see the map?

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:48.740
Try your hardest, Perrine-san.
You're the only one who can read it.

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:50.240
You can do it!

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.030
I see.

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.330
It says if we continue straight ahead, we'll get to safety.

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:58.580
Straight ahead?

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.120
Yes. I'm going on.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.330
Perrine-san!

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:06.420
Ah! A pit!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:08.380
I'm gonna fall in!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.340
Are you all right, Perrine-san?!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.340
Well that wasn't very safe.

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.640
What do you think?

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.350
Someone was walking here recently.

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:20.560
My guess is they went inside.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.060
Which way did they go?

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:24.270
Shall we split up?

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:28.150
It's dangerous to split up.
Let's try the right side.

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:31.240
They're really making us work to find them.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.870
But exploring like this is fun!

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:35.160
We're not here to have fun.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:37.990
This looks like a man-made cave.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:43.120
The place we're using as a base is the ruins of an old Witch community.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.790
Maybe this cave is part of it.

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:47.300
Oh?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:51.760
Well, that is one impressive pot.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.090
Our predecessors must have made it.

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.800
It's incredible.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.180
It really is.

00:15:58.220 --> 00:16:00.730
Who cares about that?

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:05.190
Watch out!

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:08.820
Major!

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:11.030
Wh-What is this?

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.570
Mio!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.860
Major!

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:19.330
Take this!

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:21.450
You did it!

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:22.160
Mio!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.000
Are you all right, Mio? Say something!

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:24.870
Mio!

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:25.960
Hold on a second.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.540
What's that smell?

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:31.760
Huh? It's not blood.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.970
Could it be...

00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:34.720
Yeah.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:35.800
It's wine.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.260
Huh? M-Mio?

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.060
Heave-ho!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:46.060
Huh?! Uh, Mio... Er, Major, are you all right?

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.230
Of course...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.820
I'm duper-super!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:57.780
M-Major?

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:58.620
Wh-Wh-Wha...

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:02.910
She ran away.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:05.160
Heave-ho!

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.170
Hold on, Major!
Heave-ho!

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.290
Wh-What was that?

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.000
What do we do, Minna?

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:11.300
Minna?

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:14.050
Minna's gonna need a minute.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:15.510
Right.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.800
I think she's unable to lead.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.390
What's that creepy voice?

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.940
I don't know!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:27.850
Guys!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:28.560
Hide!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:32.690
Did you see that?

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.320
Yeah. A person?

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.280
Could it be an angry spirit from the past?

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.200
Angry spirit?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.240
Let's get out of here!

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.030
I agree with her, Perrine-san.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:44.040
No. I am continuing on.

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.540
I'm coming for you, treasure!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:47.670
Perrine-san!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.920
Wait!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:52.090
Don't leave me!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.550
Guys, how much farther do we have to go?

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.470
Hang in there, Lucchini-chan.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:00.260
We're almost there.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:02.010
I'm sure it's just past this light.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.350
Really?

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.020
It's such a big room!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:12.320
Is this the treasure room from the map?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:16.030
Without a doubt! We've finally made it here!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:18.400
What a huge stone statue.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.820
It's as big as the giant Buddha in Kamakura.

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:23.030
But it's kind of scary.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:27.040
That's it! Behind the statue!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.040
The treasure rests in there.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.830
I'm going.

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:33.170
Huh?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.800
Wow!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:36.130
So cool!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.090
Where... Where's the treasure?

00:18:40.380 --> 00:18:42.510
Or rather, the children's bridge.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:45.850
Da-da-da!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.890
What do you think? Pretty cool, huh?

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:49.390
It suits you perfectly!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.060
Yeah?

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.190
You look so cool, Lucchini-chan!

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.150
I think I'm taking these home with me.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.570
Th-The statue...

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:04.700
Perrine-san, run!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:06.080
I can't!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.790
I'm not giving up

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.500
until the bridge is repaired!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:14.500
<i>But I am at a disadvantage without a weapon...</i>

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.420
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:20.470
Perrine!

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:28.100
<i>Father, Mother, and all the people of Gallia...</i>

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.600
<i>I will not be defeated!</i>

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.320
<i>Tonnerre!</i>

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.160
Perrine-san!

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.620
You did it! You won!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.880
You're amazing, Perrine-san!

00:19:56.920 --> 00:19:58.550
There's a door there?

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:00.670
Th-The treasure!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.010
So this is the treasure chamber.

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:10.640
These are herbs?

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:12.020
Cloves and bay leaves...

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.810
Oregano and saffron...

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.810
And that's pepper...

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.360
You're telling me <i>this</i> is the treasure?

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:24.990
Perrine!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:25.820
Huh?!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.280
Wh-What are you doing here, Major?

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.540
Are you crying, Perrine?

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:33.040
It's just that...

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:37.210
I searched so hard for this treasure,

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.300
and it's nothing but an herb garden.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.720
Maybe these were rare spices in the past,

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:45.510
but you can get these anywhere now...

00:20:45.930 --> 00:20:49.220
This won't make me any
money to help repair Gallia!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:52.680
Don't cry, Perrine.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:54.810
It's how you feel that matters.

00:20:55.270 --> 00:21:00.110
The feelings you have towards Gallia are a treasure above all others.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:02.070
Major...

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.490
Oh, Lucchini's here.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.030
And Miyafuji, Perrine, and Lynne.

00:21:08.030 --> 00:21:10.120
All right. Let's go, Hartmann.

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:11.700
So heavy...

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:13.830
Hey! What were you guys doing?

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:14.960
Shirley-san!

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.080
We were worried about you.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.670
Wanna go back?

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:22.880
Yeah.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:28.260
So I guess that was the ruins of
ancient Witches who cast spells

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:30.510
to protect their treasure.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:33.140
And that's probably what attacked Perrine-san.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.390
It was so obtrusive.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:39.310
Here. You received a letter, Perrine-san.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:42.230
Huh? It's from Gallia.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:44.240
This is...

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.320
A bridge!

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:47.490
They worked together and built it!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:51.410
<i>A bridge built by everyone lending a hand...</i>

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:54.790
<i>That just might be what "restoration" is all about.</i>

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:56.000
<i>I'm so glad.</i>

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.500
Isn't that great, Perrine-san?

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:02.210
Yes. Now I want to destroy the Neuroi as quickly as possible,

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:03.630
and return to Gallia.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:05.340
I want to go, too!

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:06.800
Yeah, let's all go!

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:09.470
In that case,

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:12.140
I suppose I can show
you guys around, then.

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:14.930
Thank you, Perrine-san!

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:20.900
My skin stings...

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.190
I can't put my pants on like this.

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:26.360
I see. The base is full of mysteries.

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:29.110
Oh yeah. What happened to the Lieutenant Colonel?

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:30.200
Huh?

00:24:12.590 --> 00:24:15.340
Hey, Hartmann, how many
Neuroi have you shot down?

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:18.010
One, two, three... I don't know!

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:22.480
Next time on <i>Strike Witches 2:</i> 500 overs!

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:24.440
Uh, how many was it?
